n=a3.m9(b4,'Welcome to LawBuddy ("we", "our", or "us"). LawBuddy is an Indian property and legal technology assistant designed to assist users in analyzing property agreements, understanding clause-level risks, reviewing RERA and statutory citations, estimating stamp duty, and tracking due diligence checklists.\n\nThis Privacy Policy explains what information is collected, how it is stored and processed, how AI and OCR technologies are utilized, and what controls you have over your data.',"1",b1,b2,a8?"\u092a\u0930\u093f\u091a\u092f (Introduction)":"Introduction")
m=a3.m9(b4,"Based on the current application implementation, we collect and store the following information:\n\n\u2022 Account Information: Your full name, email address, password hash (encrypted via bcrypt), optional phone number, profile avatar reference, and account timestamps (creation, last login).\n\u2022 Document & Contract Data: Property contracts, sale deeds, lease agreements, and text snippets uploaded via file upload, camera photo, or direct text input.\n\u2022 File Data & Hash: File names, document sizes, computed SHA-256 hashes, and base64-encoded file/image data when documents are uploaded.\n\u2022 Extracted Text & Segmentation: Text extracted from documents (via digital parsing, OCR, or vision extraction), normalized text, and segmented legal clauses.\n\u2022 Analysis Results: Clause risk classifications (High Risk, Caution, Compliant), legal findings, statutory citations (e.g., RERA, Transfer of Property Act), buyer impact explanations, and recommendations.\n\u2022 Chat & Consultation History: User queries, questions, and AI-generated responses submitted within the AI Chat Assistant.\n\u2022 Due Diligence Checklist Data: Saved checklist types (e.g., resale buying, builder purchase), custom checklist items, and item completion statuses.\n\u2022 User Preferences: UI theme preference (Light/Dark) and language preference (English/Hindi).","2",b1,b2,a8?"\u0939\u092e \u0915\u094c\u0928 \u0938\u0940 \u091c\u093e\u0928\u0915\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u090f\u0915\u0924\u094d\u0930 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902 (Information We Collect)":"Information We Collect")
l=a3.m9(b4,"We use the collected information to provide and operate the LawBuddy platform features:\n\n\u2022 To authenticate your user account session using JSON Web Tokens (JWT).\n\u2022 To extract clauses and analyze contractual risks against Indian statutory provisions (including RERA, the Indian Contract Act, and the Registration Act).\n\u2022 To display clause risk classifications, reasons, and recommendations on screen.\n\u2022 To generate conversational legal responses and contextual explanations in the Legal AI chat.\n\u2022 To calculate state-specific stamp duty and registration fee estimates.\n\u2022 To store and maintain your saved document history and transaction due diligence checklists.","3",b1,b2,a8?"\u0939\u092e \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u091c\u093e\u0928\u0915\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u0915\u093e \u0909\u092a\u092f\u094b\u0917 \u0915\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902 (How We Use Your Information)":"How We Use Your Information")
k=a3.m9(b4,"Uploaded property and legal documents frequently contain personal information, including but not limited to:\n\n\u2022 Names of buyers, sellers, landlords, tenants, witnesses, or representatives\n\u2022 Property residential, commercial, or municipal addresses\n\u2022 Survey numbers, plot/khasra numbers, CTS numbers, and registration particulars\n\u2022 Financial consideration amounts, payment schedules, and stamp duty values\n\u2022 Aadhaar, PAN, or other identity references where present in the deed text\n\u2022 Other terms, covenants, and personal information contained within the submitted document.\n\nUploaded documents are processed in their submitted form to perform legal risk analysis. Document records and analysis results are associated with your authenticated account in our database.","4",b1,b2,a8?"\u0915\u093e\u0928\u0942\u0928\u0940 \u0926\u0938\u094d\u0924\u093e\u0935\u0947\u091c \u0914\u0930 \u0935\u094d\u092f\u0915\u094d\u0924\u093f\u0917\u0924 \u0921\u0947\u091f\u093e (Legal Documents and Personal Data)":"Legal Documents and Personal Data")
j=a3.m9(b4,"To provide automated contract review and conversational legal guidance, LawBuddy utilizes generative AI services (Google Gemini API):\n\n\u2022 Transmission for Processing: When you request AI-powered document analysis or ask questions in the Legal AI assistant, relevant extracted text, segmented clauses, or document images are transmitted to Google's Gemini API to process the content and generate risk evaluations, statutory citations, and contextual responses.\n\u2022 Scope of AI Transmission: This transmission may include the personal and property details contained within the uploaded document or conversation query as needed to evaluate contractual terms.\n\u2022 Third-Party AI Data Handling: Processing by the Gemini API is subject to Google's applicable API terms and privacy policies. LawBuddy does not control or make representations regarding Google's internal data retention or server-side logging beyond standard API request handling.\n\u2022 Vision Fallback: For scanned documents, photographs, or PDFs where on-device text recognition is not utilized, document image data is transmitted to the Gemini API for multimodal vision extraction.","5",b1,b2,a8?"\u090f\u0906\u0908-\u0938\u0902\u091a\u093e\u0932\u093f\u0924 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0938\u0902\u0938\u094d\u0915\u0930\u0923 (AI-Powered Processing)":"AI-Powered Processing & Gemini Disclosure")
i=a3.m9(b4,"We implement reasonable technical and organizational measures to safeguard your information:\n\n\u2022 Authentication & Passwords: User passwords are encrypted using bcrypt hashing before storage. User sessions are verified using JSON Web Tokens (JWT).\n\u2022 Database Storage: User accounts, document metadata, analysis results, chat sessions, and checklists are stored in a MongoDB database.\n\u2022 Data Isolation: Backend API routes enforce user authentication and restrict document queries to the authenticated user ID.\n\nHowever, no method of electronic transmission or digital storage is 100% secure. While we strive to protect your data, we cannot guarantee absolute security.","6",b1,b2,a8?"\u0926\u0938\u094d\u0924\u093e\u0935\u0947\u091c\u093c \u092d\u0902\u0921\u093e\u0930\u0923 \u0914\u0930 \u0938\u0941\u0930\u0915\u094d\u0937\u093e (Document Storage and Security)":"Document Storage and Security")
h=a3.m9(b4,"LawBuddy integrates specific third-party technologies to deliver its features:\n\n\u2022 Google ML Kit (On-Device OCR): On supported mobile devices (Android/iOS), camera captures of physical documents are processed locally on the device using Google ML Kit to extract raw text before analysis.\n\u2022 Google Gemini API (Cloud AI): Used for natural language contract analysis, statutory citation matching, conversational assistance, and multimodal vision processing for scanned documents where on-device OCR is not applied.\n\u2022 MongoDB: For persistent database storage of user accounts, documents, chats, and checklists.\n\u2022 SMTP Email Service: For sending email verification codes where configured.","7",b1,b2,a8?"\u0924\u0943\u0924\u0940\u092f-\u092a\u0915\u094d\u0937 \u0938\u0947\u0935\u093e\u090f\u0902 (Third-Party Services)":"Third-Party Services & OCR Processing")
g=a3.m9(b4,"We retain your account information, saved document records, chat conversations, and checklists for as long as your account exists in the database.\n\n\u2022 Document Deletion: You can delete individual document records directly from the Recent Documents section in the app, which removes the document record from the database.\n\u2022 Chat Deletion: You can clear or delete chat sessions within the chat interface.\n\u2022 Account Removal: For full account deletion or assistance, please contact the administrator via the contact information below.","8",b1,b2,a8?"\u0921\u0947\u091f\u093e \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093f\u0927\u093e\u0930\u0923 \u0914\u0930 \u0939\u091f\u093e\u0928\u093e (Data Retention & Deletion)":"Data Retention & Deletion")
f=a3.m9(b4,"In accordance with applicable Indian data protection principles, including the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023:\n\n\u2022 You may review your saved documents, analysis findings, and checklists directly within the application.\n\u2022 You may delete individual document analyses and chat records at any time.\n\u2022 You may update your profile name and contact information in your account settings.\n\u2022 For data inquiries or account deletion requests, you may reach out using the contact details provided in this policy.","9",b1,b2,a8?"\u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u0917\u094b\u092a\u0928\u0940\u092f\u0924\u093e \u0905\u0927\u093f\u0915\u093e\u0930 (Your Privacy Rights)":"Your Privacy Rights")
e=a3.m9(b4,"LawBuddy utilizes local storage mechanisms on your device (via SharedPreferences, which maps securely to browser storage on Flutter Web) to ensure essential operation:\n\n\u2022 Strictly Necessary Session Data: Authentication information is stored locally to maintain your signed-in session and authorize document analysis requests. This data is essential for account security.\n\u2022 Functional Preferences: Your theme preference (Light or Dark mode) and language selection (English or Hindi) may be retained locally so your interface choices persist between visits.\n\u2022 No Tracking or Marketing Trackers: LawBuddy currently does not use advertising cookies, marketing pixels, cross-site trackers, or behavioral analytics beacons.\n\u2022 Privacy & Storage Controls: You can view or adjust your functional storage preference at any time directly within the application.","10",b1,b2,a8?"\u092c\u094d\u0930\u093e\u0909\u091c\u093c\u0930 \u0938\u0902\u0917\u094d\u0930\u0939\u0923 \u0914\u0930 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u093e\u0925\u092e\u093f\u0915\u0924\u093e\u090f\u0902 (Device Storage & Preferences)":"Device Storage, Preferences & Cookies")
